+# Optional: send HUD summaries to any OpenAI-compatible chat completions
+# server instead of OpenAI (base URL ending before /chat/completions, e.g.
+# http://127.0.0.1:8791/v1). Unset keeps the OpenAI-or-keyless behavior.
